@namespace SKS_Blazor.Pages.Product

@* The screen opened as a modal. It is the same component the route renders, so the
   two entry points stay one implementation and cannot drift apart. DynamicComponent
   sidesteps the name collision between a component and the namespace sharing its
   name, which a plain element reference cannot express. *@
<MudDialog>
    <DialogContent>
        <DynamicComponent Type="typeof(SKS_Blazor.Pages.Product.AddProductTo)" />
    </DialogContent>
</MudDialog>
